# Keep the runtime package deterministic when Faultline is installed directly
# from Git (used by the hosted Vercel deployment).
#
# NOTE ON fixtures/
#
# `fixtures/recorder/` is RUNTIME data, not test data, despite the directory
# name. src/recorder/simulate.mjs reads it through loadScenario()/listScenarios()
# to drive the Flight Recorder, and the hosted demo's recorded investigations
# replay those scenarios - so /api/demo/incidents/* returns 404 without them.
#
# It used to be excluded here alongside tests/, which packaged a build whose
# demo investigations could not load. Test fixtures are a separate tree
# (tests/fixtures/) and are still excluded with the rest of tests/.
#
# tests/packaging.test.mjs asserts the packed tarball still contains every
# scenario the demo catalogue names, so this cannot silently regress again.

.github/
build/
data/
docs/
test/
tests/
coverage/
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
docker-compose.yml
ROADMAP.md
